msgid "September 2026 {#september-2026}"
msgstr "September 2026 {#september-2026}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New tools have been built on top of the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) framework, which was released earlier this year:\n"
msgstr "Tools baru telah dibangun di atas kerangka [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) yang dirilis awal tahun ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`qiskit-noise-learning`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-noise-learning) is a toolkit for randomization-based quantum noise characterization. You can use it to construct a custom noise-learning experiment, validate it with local simulation, and analyze the raw results.\n"
msgstr "[`qiskit-noise-learning`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-noise-learning) adalah toolkit untuk karakterisasi noise kuantum berbasis randomisasi. Kamu bisa memakainya untuk menyusun eksperimen noise-learning khusus, memvalidasinya dengan simulasi lokal, dan menganalisis hasil mentahnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`qiskit-mitigation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation) is a package of quantum error mitigation methods for building mitigation pipelines with the new execution model. It includes implementations of well-known methods, including PEC, PEA, TREX, and gate-folding ZNE, as well as post-selection for filtering out non-Markovian errors.\n"
msgstr "[`qiskit-mitigation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation) adalah paket metode mitigasi error kuantum untuk membangun pipeline mitigasi dengan execution model yang baru. Paket ini mencakup implementasi metode-metode terkenal, termasuk PEC, PEA, TREX, dan ZNE berbasis gate-folding, serta post-selection untuk menyaring error non-Markovian.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "August 2026 {#august-2026}"
msgstr "Agustus 2026 {#august-2026}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Fermions](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-fermions) had its first release this month! This package provides tools for working with fermionic systems, including building fermionic operators and circuits, implementing fermion-to-qubit encodings, and circuit synthesis through the Qiskit transpiler integration. Qiskit Fermions can be used with other complementary tools in the ecosystem, such as `ffsim` (see this [documentation](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) and [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/ffsim) for more information) and the [SQD addon](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), to build advanced workflows for fermionic systems. \n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Fermions](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-fermions) merilis versi pertamanya bulan ini! Paket ini menyediakan tools untuk bekerja dengan sistem fermionik, termasuk membangun operator dan Circuit fermionik, mengimplementasikan encoding fermion-ke-qubit, dan sintesis Circuit lewat integrasi Qiskit Transpiler. Qiskit Fermions bisa dipakai bersama tools pelengkap lain di ekosistem, seperti `ffsim` (lihat [dokumentasi](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) dan [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/ffsim) ini untuk informasi lebih lanjut) dan [SQD addon](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), untuk membangun alur kerja canggih bagi sistem fermionik. \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See how these tools are applied in practice with the [SqDRIFT algorithm for ground state estimation](/tutorials/sqdrift) tutorial and the following guide: [Building constant-depth circuits to simulate the dynamics of the 1- and 2-D Fermi-Hubbard model](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-fermions/guides/1-d-fermi-hubbard). Check out the [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-fermions) and [documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-fermions) to get started.\n"
msgstr "Lihat bagaimana tools ini diterapkan dalam praktik lewat tutorial [algoritma SqDRIFT untuk estimasi ground state](/tutorials/sqdrift) dan panduan berikut: [Membangun Circuit berkedalaman konstan untuk mensimulasikan dinamika model Fermi-Hubbard 1-D dan 2-D](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-fermions/guides/1-d-fermi-hubbard). Baca [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-fermions) dan [dokumentasi](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-fermions) untuk mulai.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "June 2026 {#june-2026}"
msgstr "Juni 2026 {#june-2026}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-12 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introducing [Qiskit Paulice](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice): a new addon that integrates low-overhead quantum error detection into quantum circuits to boost the fidelity of measured distributions. It provides single-shot access to the quantum state and so can be used in both sampling-based and expectation value-based workflows. Check out the [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-paulice) and [documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice) for how to get started today.\n"
msgstr "Memperkenalkan [Qiskit Paulice](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice): addon baru yang mengintegrasikan deteksi error kuantum dengan overhead rendah ke dalam Circuit kuantum untuk meningkatkan fidelitas distribusi yang diukur. Addon ini menyediakan akses single-shot ke state kuantum sehingga bisa digunakan baik dalam alur kerja berbasis sampling maupun berbasis nilai ekspektasi. Lihat [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-paulice) dan [dokumentasi](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice) untuk mengetahui cara memulai hari ini.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous updates {#previous-updates}"
msgstr "Pembaruan sebelumnya {#previous-updates}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recently released two new addons that use classical resources to reduce the quantum resources needed for error mitigation:\n"
msgstr "Kami baru saja merilis dua addon baru yang menggunakan sumber daya klasik untuk mengurangi sumber daya kuantum yang dibutuhkan untuk mitigasi error:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Propagated noise absorption (PNA)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/) is a technique for mitigating errors in expectation values by absorbing the inverses of the learned noise channels into observables using Pauli propagation. \n"
msgstr "[Propagated noise absorption (PNA)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/) adalah teknik untuk memitigasi error pada nilai ekspektasi dengan menyerap invers dari kanal noise yang dipelajari ke dalam observable menggunakan propagasi Pauli. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Shaded lightcones (SLC)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) addon uses classical simulations to more tightly bound the sensitivity to errors throughout the circuit. This allows for more efficient, targeted applications of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) with reduced variance.\n"
msgstr "Addon [Shaded lightcones (SLC)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) menggunakan simulasi klasik untuk membatasi sensitivitas terhadap error di seluruh Circuit secara lebih ketat. Ini memungkinkan penerapan Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) yang lebih efisien dan tertarget dengan varians yang berkurang.\n"
